WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
This stupid brother is just a hunter in the mountains

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,040
I’ve definitely never seen the prosperity of a big city.

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,480
First remember his yearning for the city

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,480
Use your account as bait to protect your uncle again

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,160
Do you often come to my sister-in-law’s dormitory to watch TV?

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,120
This color shop is a good one

7
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,760
It’s okay to learn about the outside world, especially big cities, through it.

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:15,240
I also have a lottery shop at home. I don’t care about watching it. Have you ever seen the movie? Uncle Huzi, don’t look at it. I’m only in the third grade of junior high school.

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:20,400
But I've seen a lot of movies like "Transformers", "Moon Wolf 2", "One Month Lost", and "Diary of the King's Comforter". I've seen them all.

10
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,720
No, we have to change direction.

11
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,000
I have an idle little bicycle at home, isn’t it a 212 Jeep? If my sister-in-law goes back,

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,040
Just a good place to sit while waiting.

13
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:31,060
I've also driven a small bicycle. I've driven everything in a hurry.

14
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,260
I have to run hundreds of kilometers a day.

15
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,900
Sometimes I have to go to the airport four or five times. I have never heard of cycling.

16
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,020
There is definitely no Fulba Haona in my family.

17
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,020
Have you ever lived in a small bungalow?

18
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:38,980
My home is a small bungalow

19
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:42,460
The whole floor is empty. If my sister-in-law goes back later, she can just sleep in the small bungalow.

20
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,620
I have never stayed in a small bungalow before

21
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,020
But I often give food to the tenants in the rental house. They would starve to death without me. I still prefer it.

22
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,140
Forty or fifty storey high-end apartments

23
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,460
Corridors and elevators are monitored

24
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,980
The kind with round-the-clock butler service

25
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,300
This person also knows about surveillance

26
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,780
Also know about high-end apartments

27
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,860
Could it be that I underestimated him and there is nothing I can do about it?

28
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,980
We can only show our cards.

29
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:56,940
Uncle Protector

30
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,260
Do you want to set up an account?

31
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,700
If you could persuade my sister-in-law to return to the city

32
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,820
You can go back with me

33
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:03,300
If my father can arrange a job for you, I will accompany you and tell you Lin Xiangyang

34
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:06,380
You are mistaking me

35
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:08,220
Lin Xia is my dearest relative and friend

36
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:09,540
He's my food partner

37
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,860
All you need to do is learn to guard the pig

38
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:15,120
The emperors can take women home as their wives

39
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,560
You actually want to ask me to betray her

40
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,520
Advise her to return to the city

41
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,160
Believe it or not, I will whip you directly

42
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,760
Just the shit your daddy did.

43
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:24,180
Lin Xia will never go home

44
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:26,020
Fortunately, I have the talent of a practical scholar.

45
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:28,980
I smell Lin Xia listening in the corner, otherwise I will be caught and trapped. Uncle Zi, please keep your voice down.

46
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,020
Hide my sister-in-law back again

47
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,060
You don’t understand what’s going on here

48
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:32,140
A big family like ours

49
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:35,200
Hedging your bets is commonplace

50
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,440
These inside stories

51
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:40,300
Does your sister-in-law know? Yes.

52
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,580
Your sister-in-law is kind-hearted

53
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:42,940
Even if I know the inside story, I won’t forgive your father.

54
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,180
It's your father's fault

55
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,540
But you are a fifteen or sixteen year old girl.

56
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:46,980
Where do you get so many words?

57
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:48,300
My dad studies those things at home every day

58
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:49,620
I don’t need to learn how to do it

59
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:51,460
These three oily dishes should be cooked faster.

60
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,500
Mi Gao has to fight for the tiger's son again

61
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:58,360
Come and try my sister’s delicious cooking, Lin Xia

62
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:01,400
Your skills are really getting better and better. I’ve been coming here every day since the summer vacation.

63
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,560
Sister eats sister-in-law for you every day

64
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:07,120
There is a minor here. Whose minor has so many new eyes?

65
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:09,260
Eat quickly

66
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:10,500
Thank you Lin Xiangyang

67
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,860
This last-minute assist

68
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,290
Who can withstand it?

69
00:02:13,290 --> 00:02:15,130
It’s a pity that there is no Huang Bangmi these days

70
00:02:15,170 --> 00:02:18,970
Otherwise I have to fuck him twice, Uncle Hu Zi, you slap him so hard in the face

71
00:02:18,970 --> 00:02:19,970
Can you take me into the mountains?

72
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:21,010
What's wrong with a kid?

73
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:23,050
There are man-eating tigers in the mountains

74
00:02:23,050 --> 00:02:24,580
Your sister-in-law is right

75
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:25,500
But I'm here this time

76
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,320
I still want to get a squirrel

77
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,800
The one with red fur
